  dialogueContainer: {fileID: 1268790097}
  dialogueLines:
  - Now usually, just like Amin, he just points and says "I want that".
  - But, how about Aiman?
  - He knows what he wants. But words don't always come.
  - Here, this is a Picture Exchange Communication System (PECS) cards.
  - Use this to communicate with Aiman.
  - Don't forget to be on his eye level. Give it a try.
